  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Monika finds her foot stuck in a crevice, while Veezara attempts to capitalize
    on her mistake. Again.
  - Veezara drops vorpal blades of Sithis from above. Again.
  - Veezara slashes his dark blade at Monika. Again.
  - Veezara takes a well-practiced stance, repeatedly slashing at Monika to drain
    her strength. Again.
  - Veezara rolls to his right, with a Shadow Veezara appearing to roll to his left,
    both slashing at Monika. Again.
  - A dark pressure pushes down on Monika from above, with Veezara slashing at her.
    Again.
  - A dark pressure pushes down on Monika from above, with Veezara preparing concentrated
    bursts of vorpal blades. Again.
